---
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <a href="/" class="footer-logo">🌙 快眠ラボ</a>
      <p class="footer-desc">枕・マットレス・布団などの寝具を徹底比較。<br>睡眠の悩みを解決する商品選びをサポートします。</p>
      <a
        href="https://www.instagram.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="insta-link"
        aria-label="Instagram"
      >
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/>
          <circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
        </svg>
        @kaimin_labo
      </a>
    </div>
    <nav class="footer-nav">
      <div class="footer-nav-col">
        <p class="footer-nav-title">カテゴリー</p>
        <a href="/mattress/">マットレス</a>
        <a href="/review/">レビュー</a>
        <a href="/column/">コラム</a>
        <a href="/pillow/">枕</a>
        <a href="/futon/">布団</a>
        <a href="/cover/">カバー・シーツ</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-nav-col">
        <p class="footer-nav-title">サイト情報</p>
        <a href="/about/">運営者情報</a>
        <a href="/privacy/">プライバシーポリシー</a>
        <a href="/disclaimer/">免責事項</a>
        <a href="/contact/">お問い合わせ</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="footer-copy">&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} 快眠ラボ. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p class="footer-ad-note">※当サイトはアフィリエイト広告を利用しています。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: var(--color-bg-dark);
    color: #ccc;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }
  .footer-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding: 3rem 1rem 2rem;
  }
  .footer-logo {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .footer-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .insta-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    color: #ccc;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .insta-link:hover { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
  .footer-nav { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
  .footer-nav-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .footer-nav-title { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .footer-nav-col a { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #aaa; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .footer-nav-col a:hover { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  .footer-bottom .container { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .footer-copy { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #888; }
  .footer-ad-note { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #888; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .footer-nav { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; }
  }
</style>
